}
[4.body] 车身子 Agent RAG 命中: ev-body-01
[5.body] 车身子 Agent 输出 JSON
{
  "status": "supported",
  "summary": "The architecture emphasizes a lightweight body structure utilizing a steel-aluminum hybrid approach to enhance repairability while maintaining crash safety. The design incorporates a low-drag exterior profile with features such as hidden door handles and an active grille for improved aerodynamics. An engineering trade-off exists between achieving optimal aerodynamic performance and ensuring effective crash load paths, with the assumption that structural integrity must not be compromised for weight reduction."
}
[4.chassis] 底盘子 Agent RAG 命中: ev-chassis-01
[5.chassis] 底盘子 Agent 输出 JSON
{
  "status": "supported",
  "summary": "The architecture focuses on optimizing vibration isolation and steering response for the chassis in urban low-speed conditions. Key components affected include the suspension system and steering mechanism, which are designed to retain mechanical redundancy while enhancing ride comfort. An engineering trade-off exists between achieving lightweight construction and maintaining collision safety, with the assumption that a balance can be struck without compromising structural integrity."
}
